@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api
@moduleId = 000000000000000000000000
@trailId = 000000000000000000000000

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Auth — Registrar
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria Silva",
  "email": "maria@startup.com.br",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Auth — Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "maria@startup.com.br",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Auth — Usuário atual
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me

### Auth — Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout

### Perfil — Obter (RN9)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me

### Perfil — Atualizar (RN9)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria Silva",
  "jobTitle": "Product Manager",
  "startupStage": "validacao",
  "learningStyle": "visual"
}

### Perfil — Upload de avatar (RN9)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/me/avatar
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----PegepsBoundary

------PegepsBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="avatar"; filename="avatar.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./avatar.png
------PegepsBoundary--

### Diagnóstico — Listar 3 perguntas (sem gabarito)
GET {{baseUrl}}/diagnostic/questions

### Diagnóstico — Enviar respostas
POST {{baseUrl}}/diagnostic/submit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answers": [
    { "questionId": "diag-mvp", "optionId": "a" },
    { "questionId": "diag-validacao", "optionId": "a" },
    { "questionId": "diag-priorizacao", "optionId": "c" }
  ]
}

### Trilhas — Opções (recomendada vs padrão)
GET {{baseUrl}}/trails/options

### Trilhas — Escolher trilha inicial por ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/trails/choose
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trailId": "{{trailId}}"
}

### Trilhas — Grafo da trilha ativa
GET {{baseUrl}}/trails/active

### Tutor Tom — Iniciar fluxo
GET {{baseUrl}}/tutor/start

### Tutor Tom — Avançar etapa
POST {{baseUrl}}/tutor/step
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "select_style",
  "learningStyle": "visual"
}

### Avaliações — Listar módulos e status
GET {{baseUrl}}/assessments

### Avaliações — Iniciar tentativa (10 questões sem gabarito)
POST {{baseUrl}}/assessments/{{moduleId}}/start

### Avaliações — Enviar respostas
POST {{baseUrl}}/assessments/{{moduleId}}/submit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "variantId": "var-1",
  "answers": [
    { "questionId": "q1", "selectedOptionId": "a" }
  ]
}

### Adaptação — Status do cooldown (15 dias)
GET {{baseUrl}}/trails/adapt/status

### Adaptação — Adaptar trilha com IA (RN7)
POST {{baseUrl}}/trails/adapt/ai
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "context": "Nosso time está com dificuldade para priorizar funcionalidades e validar hipóteses com clientes."
}

### Adaptação — Solicitar especialista (RN8)
POST {{baseUrl}}/trails/adapt/specialist
